# S411: start.p2s is paused on the quit dialog with NO lit. Cross takes NO, Start resumes, gas from tick 66;
# the probe left the first lip at row 140 and landed at row 185.
down cross
sleep 3t
up cross
sleep 30t
down start
sleep 3t
up start
sleep 30t
down cross
# S472: flip.pad with the stick back 30t, not 50: the backflip lands short with its clip running (a wreck).
# R1 and the stick forward on the climb, back on the lip, R1 held through the air; the bike rides on down.
sleep 42t
down r1
stick l 0 -1
sleep 20t
stick l 0 1
sleep 30t
stick l 0 0
up r1
sleep 140t
release
sleep 10t
